                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">2025年11月9日，是第34个全国消防日，国务院安委会办公室定于11月份在全国开展消防宣传月活动。2025年全国消防宣传月活动主题是“全民消防、生命至上——安全用电用火”。为切实做好校园内的消防（防火）安全工作，确保学校一旦发生火情时，做到反应迅速、分工明确、处置有序、及时扑灭，努力使人员伤亡和财产损失减小到最低限度，特组织此次消防应急疏散演练。</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:37px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 黑体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 21px">一、组织领导</span></strong></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">总指挥：</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">蒋</span><span style="font-family:仿宋">明</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px"> </span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">副总指挥：</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">任联君、</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">何隽豪、孟德超、陈炳炉、林萍华、</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">孙</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">舒曼、俞一凡</span><span style="font-family:仿宋">  </span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">宿舍楼出口疏散负责人：王斌、郑祥霖、金楚翰</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">、</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">韩伟</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">集合场地负责人：何隽豪</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">道路疏散负责人</span><span style="font-family:仿宋">:王宁</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">、</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">保安</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">1</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">人</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">警报、广播、电子屏：张帆、祝建强、曹启明</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">摄影：舒凤</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">医务：范国娟</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">宿舍管理老师：王青、商晶、单兴妹、陆海萍、俞金璐、兰岚</span><span style="font-family:仿宋"> </span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:37px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 黑体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 21px">二、组织分工</span></strong></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">王青和单兴妹：检查、清理消防通道，演练前打开消防通道大门，演练中检查</span><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 21px">利楼</span></strong><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">宿舍内有无人员滞留。单兴妹疏散引导</span><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 21px">利楼</span></strong><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">东侧，王青疏散引导</span><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 21px">利楼</span></strong><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">西侧。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">兰岚和陆海萍：检查、清理消防通道，演练前打开消防通道大门，演练中检查</span><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 21px">贞楼</span></strong><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">宿舍内有无人员滞留。兰岚疏散引导</span><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 21px">贞楼</span></strong><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">西侧，陆海萍疏散引导</span><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 21px">贞楼</span></strong><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">东侧。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">张帆：警报声发出、学校篮球场扩音设备、报告厅话筒投影仪等设备准备。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">王宁在</span><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 21px">利楼西侧出口</span></strong><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">引导学生到集合场地，陈炳炉在</span><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 21px">利楼东侧出口</span></strong><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">引导学生到集合场地。王斌在</span><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 21px">贞楼西侧出口</span></strong><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">引导学生到集合场地，郑祥霖在</span><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 21px">贞楼东侧出口</span></strong><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">引导学生到集合场地。</span><span style="font-family:仿宋"> </span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">金楚翰：在</span><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 21px">利楼、贞楼</span></strong><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">学生公寓大厅东门出口处维护秩序和疏散引导</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">商晶</span><span style="font-family:仿宋">: 在</span></span><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 21px">利楼、贞楼</span></strong><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">学生公寓西门大厅出口处维护秩序和疏散引导。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">林萍华：将当天实际住校生人数报何隽豪老师。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">俞一凡：负责高二疏散学生整队（按照升旗仪式队形，高二在中间位置），并清点人数后报何隽豪老师。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">孙</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">舒曼：负责高一疏散学生整队（按照升旗仪式队形，高一在球场最南侧），并清点人数后报何隽豪老师。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">总务处：国旗前搭台（两套课桌椅）、寝室电源控制</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">祝建强：报告厅电子屏，利楼、贞楼消防信号控制，确保演练时通道畅通，演练结束后关闭。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">舒凤：摄影</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">范国娟：负责医务保障</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:37px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 黑体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 21px">三、消防讲座开始时间、集合地点及参加学生</span></strong></p><p style="margin-left: 28px;text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">时间：</span><span style="font-family:仿宋">2025年11月11日(星期二)晚上17:50起（17:40前进报告厅一），演练结束后回教室自修</span></span></p><p style="margin-left: 28px;text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">地点：学校图书馆报告厅（消防讲座）</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">，</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">篮球场（演练集合地）</span></p><p style="margin-left: 28px;text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">参加学生：高一、高二全体住校生</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:37px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 黑体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 21px">四、情景模拟</span></strong></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">1．高一、高二全体住校学生均在宿舍。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">2．紧急应对情况：宿舍内起火的紧急疏散。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">3．演练前做好的准备：由越城消防支队警官在报告厅作一消防安全知识及火场逃生的知识讲座，由安全处何隽豪主任讲清注意事项。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">4．发现寝室起火，警报声发出，总务部门切断电源并检查应急灯是否正常点亮，林萍华老师拨打119。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">5.学生按设定出口和线路迅速撤离宿舍楼，到学校篮球场集中。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">6.清点安全撤离到集合场地的学生人数，检查有无人员缺少。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">7.安全分管校长做演练总结。</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:37px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 黑体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 21px">五、演练要注意的事项</span></strong></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px"> 1．听到警报声后，全体学生必须快速、有序、安全地进行疏散，不准在寝室内滞留，也不要收拾物品下楼。即使确定本宿舍人员己经撤离，也不要关门。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">2．发生火灾时总务部门应该立即切断电源，学校启动应急方案，组织人员疏散，撤离现场。撤离时应先保证火源发生点和建筑上层的人员先撤离。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">3．宿舍楼发生紧急情况疏散时，生活指导老师要教育学生首先要冷静，稳定学生情绪，有序地组织学生呈两列队伍从东西两个楼梯下楼。并要求站在楼梯口旁边指挥学生撤离，杜绝拥挤踩踏事故，直至最后一名学生离开后才能离开，离开前还要检查所负责楼层是否有人。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">4．疏散过程中要求学生用湿毛巾捂住口鼻，低姿弯腰前行。严禁出现拥挤、推攘现象，防止意外事故的发生。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:21px">5．学生撤离宿舍后，服从学校工作人员的统一指挥安排，到学校篮球场集中。</span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px; text-indent: 43px;"> </span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:37px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 黑体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:黑体">六、演练安排</span><span style="font-family:黑体"> </span></span></strong><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px; text-indent: 43px;"> </span></p><table width="668" style="width: 551px;"><tbody><tr style="height:26px" class="firstRow"><td width="85" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-color: windowtext; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-style: solid;"><p style=";text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:37px">时 间</p></td><td width="178" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-left-color: initial; border-right-color: windowtext; border-top-color: windowtext; border-bottom-color: windowtext; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:37px">内 容</p></td><td width="94" valign="top" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-left-color: initial; border-right-color: windowtext; border-top-color: windowtext; border-bottom-color: windowtext; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:37px">地 点</p></td><td width="112" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-left-color: initial; border-right-color: windowtext; border-top-color: windowtext; border-bottom-color: windowtext; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:37px">负责人</p></td><td width="199" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-left-color: initial; border-right-color: windowtext; border-top-color: windowtext; border-bottom-color: windowtext; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:37px">备注</p></td></tr><tr style="height:26px"><td width="85" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-left-color: windowtext; border-right-color: windowtext; border-style: solid; border-top-color: initial; border-bottom-color: windowtext; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:37px">17：50</p></td><td width="178" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-left-color: initial; border-right-color: windowtext; border-top-color: initial; border-bottom-color: windowtext; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:37px">消防安全知识讲座</p></td><td width="94" valign="top" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-left-color: initial; border-right-color: windowtext; border-top-color: initial; border-bottom-color: windowtext; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:37px">报告厅</p></td><td width="112" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-left-color: initial; border-right-color: windowtext; border-top-color: initial; border-bottom-color: windowtext; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:37px">何隽豪</p></td><td width="199" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-left-color: initial; border-right-color: windowtext; border-top-color: initial; border-bottom-color: windowtext; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:37px">越城消防</p></td></tr><tr style="height:26px"><td width="85" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-left-color: windowtext; border-right-color: windowtext; border-style: solid; border-top-color: initial; border-bottom-color: windowtext; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p style=";text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:37px">18：20</p></td><td width="178" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-left-color: initial; border-right-color: windowtext; border-top-color: initial; border-bottom-color: windowtext; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:37px">演练程序介绍</p></td><td width="94" valign="top" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-left-color: initial; border-right-color: windowtext; border-top-color: initial; border-bottom-color: windowtext; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:37px">报告厅</p></td><td width="112" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-left-color: initial; border-right-color: windowtext; border-top-color: initial; border-bottom-color: windowtext; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:37px">何隽豪</p></td><td width="199" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-left-color: initial; border-right-color: windowtext; border-top-color: initial; border-bottom-color: windowtext; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">
